---
// src/components/Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative min-h-[calc(100vh-5rem)] flex items-center justify-center px-4 overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- 1. Fondo de resplandor sutil (Glow Effect) detras del texto -->
  <div 
    class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-72 h-72 sm:w-96 sm:h-96 bg-brand-primary opacity-20 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10 transition-colors duration-500"
  ></div>

  <!-- 2. Contenido principal centrado -->
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-6 z-10">
    
    <!-- Tag / Badge de bienvenida opcional -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-hover border border-strong text-xs font-medium text-brand-primary shadow-sm transition-colors duration-300">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-primary animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>Aprende a tu propio ritmo</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Título principal con gradiente y resplandor -->
    <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-primary transition-colors duration-300">
      Easy <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-secondary">English</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Descripción pequeña -->
    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-secondary max-w-xl font-normal leading-relaxed transition-colors duration-300">
      Aprende inglés fácil y gratis con lecciones interactivas diseñadas para acelerar tu aprendizaje desde el primer día.
    </p>

    <!-- Botones de Acción (CTAs) -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 mt-2 w-full sm:w-auto">
      <a 
        href="#empezar" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-primary hover:bg-brand-primary-hover text-primary font-semibold text-base shadow-lg shadow-brand-primary/20 transition-all duration-200 text-center active:scale-95"
      >
        Empezar gratis
      </a>

      <a 
        href="#cursos" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface hover:bg-surface-hover border border-strong text-secondary hover:text-primary font-semibold text-base transition-all duration-200 text-center"
      >
        Ver lecciones
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>